md running. Each scenario creates the containers, applies the role, applies it a second time and requires no changes, runs the verify, and destroys the containers.\n\n## Done when\n\na sample role's scenario passes in CI on both images, and a deliberately broken sample fails its verify.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/ci-workflows/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/ci-workflows/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}]